# The coverage job's tool (ci.yml). It holds no secret: the Codacy upload, with
# CODACY_PROJECT_TOKEN, is a separate workflow_run job (codacy-coverage.yml) that installs nothing
# from here. Pinned with hashes all the same, as every CI tool is.
#
# pip-compile turns this into coverage.txt: every package, exact versions AND hashes, installed with
# `--require-hashes`. Dependabot keeps it current by re-running pip-compile on the Python its
# header names (3.11), so a bump never pins a set that cannot be installed together. Edit
# THIS file, then regenerate (run in python:3.11-slim):
#   pip-compile --allow-unsafe --generate-hashes --no-annotate --strip-extras \
#     --output-file=coverage.txt coverage.in
coverage
